WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.845
Learn in simulation. Act in reality.

2
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:04.972
Skill2Real.

3
00:00:05.341 --> 00:00:07.155
From simulation to reality.

4
00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:14.705
The Proposer explores, the Verifier diagnoses, and the
Governor reviews skill proposals.

5
00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:20.985
The Cerebellum learns basic skills. The Brain combines
them into tasks.

6
00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:25.365
Then transfer the frozen skills through the same API.

7
00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:31.425
Grasp, carry, and place. Then move on to the next
object.

8
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:41.925
One tray, four placements. The banana remains outside.

9
00:00:42.666 --> 00:00:44.331
Make room, then pack.

10
00:00:46.206 --> 00:00:50.061
The same skills, across different objects and
backgrounds.

11
00:00:51.083 --> 00:00:53.678
New objects. Different containers.

12
00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:00.875
From soft toys to rigid blocks.

13
00:01:03.083 --> 00:01:04.668
Place, then push to fit.

18
00:01:08.996 --> 00:01:11.951
Arrange the numbers to complete the equation.

19
00:01:12.596 --> 00:01:14.511
Sort each object by color.

20
00:01:16.006 --> 00:01:17.991
Place the pepper with the lights off.

21
00:01:20.806 --> 00:01:21.760
Align the ring,

22
00:01:22.366 --> 00:01:23.281
slide it on,

23
00:01:23.956 --> 00:01:24.886
and release.

24
00:01:25.733 --> 00:01:26.748
Many worlds.

25
00:01:28.033 --> 00:01:29.338
Skills that transfer.

26
00:01:30.983 --> 00:01:32.028
Skill2Real.

